Z||000006||87ECO5||11-10-2000||01:36 PM||||Philphine:  I'm also on the Vette forum, although my username there is <B>are8see (R8C) </B> - the RPO code you select if you want to pick up your newly-acquired machine at the factory in Bowling Green.<P>Drew:  I believe the top one is a European-spec C5.  The smaller ovals within the larger ovals are amber turn signals - a requirement for overseas cars.  Or, an American owner purchased the kit for their U.S.-spec model.<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 11-10-2000).]||||reg||1
