Z||000015||87ECO5||11-16-2000||09:52 AM||||In the eighties, the Capri had basically the same body as the Mustang (biggest difference was the bubble glass hatchback instead of the Mustang's flat glass panel).  Same 5.0 motor, same wheels, same interior, etc.<P>In the nineties, the Capri lost its top (became a convertible) and its back seat.  Different body too.<P>Which one do you have, Spyro86SE?||||reg||1
